  "name": "FerroBRIDGEXadToAddressStreetThroughSad",
  "title": "FerroBRIDGE supplement: XAD to Address with the street address through SAD",
  "status": "active",
  "experimental": true,
  "publisher": "Cadasto B.V. (FerroBRIDGE)",
  "description": "Overrides ConceptMap/datatype-xad-to-address of hl7.fhir.uv.v2mappings 1.0.0. The guide maps XAD.1, the SAD street address, to line[1-3], which its mapping guidelines (§[n] Notation) read as Address.line one through three filled through datatype-sad-to-address; this interpreter does not spread one value over a range of instances, so the street address was lost. This supplement maps XAD.1 to $value, the Address itself, so datatype-sad-to-address writes SAD.1 to SAD.3 into line[1] to line[3] as the guide's own map states; every other row is the guide's. FerroBRIDGE #1716.",
